# Bounce the counter between `low` and `high` for a number of cycles.

int64 low
int64 high
uint32 cycles 1  # full low->high->low round trips
---
uint32 completed_cycles
bool interrupted  # true when the goal was canceled mid-cycle
---
int64 current    # value after the latest step
uint32 cycle     # the round trip currently running (1-based)
